# Auth Feature Rules

**Full detail:** [docs/ai/06-feature-auth.md](../../docs/ai/06-feature-auth.md)

## Structure

`data/models/` → `data/repos/` → `presentation/manager/*_cubit/`

Legacy views exist under `presentation/views/` — prefer JSON routes for new work.

## Endpoints (implemented)

- `POST /api/v1/customer/auth/otp/request`
- `POST /api/v1/customer/auth/otp/verify`

Implementation: `auth_repo_impl.dart`

## Must

- Return `Either<Failure, T>` from repo
- Persist tokens via `AuthTokenStorage` on verify
- Register cubits/repos in `service_locator.dart`

## Must not

- Use deprecated `/api/v1/auth/otp/*` paths
- Put OTP validation only in widgets (use model `validate()`)
- Bypass `AuthCubit`/`TokenCubit` for session changes

## JSON routes

`/auth/login`, `/auth/otp-reset` in `shellExcludeRoutes`
